WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,030
Zhang Yi, are you at home?

2
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:09,030
I am Zhou Peng

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:11,030
Planning to plot against me

4
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:13,100
Just you

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,100
Not qualified enough to open the door

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,100
I am Zhou Peng

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,100
I'm looking for you if I have something urgent

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:21,580
What's the matter

9
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,580
For the sake of my colleagues

10
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,580
Let's get something to eat closer.

11
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,580
I use antipyretics

12
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,580
Exchange two packs of instant noodles

13
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:33,980
Don't fall behind before it's true

14
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,330
I'll think about it

15
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,020
Hurry up and open the door to exchange

16
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,020
I really can't hold it anymore
